        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/f3ff860fbffd4eb8fbec3d20f95e2426.avif?t=1782584701\" width=366 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Axe &amp; Bow Land</i>, players take on the roles of brothers Axel and Bowie, warriors chosen by an ancient prophecy and armed with sacred relics: a magical axe that can freeze enemies and a divine bow. Set in a mythical era inspired by Aztec culture, the game tells the story of a once-peaceful land, now corrupted by a strange dark energy emerging from an ancient temple. Axel and Bowie, immune to this malevolent force, are the only ones capable of embarking on the journey to restore peace and balance to their homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds across six unique worlds, each containing five levels that offer diverse challenges: from platforming stages filled with puzzles — inspired by games like <i>ElecHead</i> — to intense boss battles and fast-paced <i>shoot ’em up</i> levels. Each world is meticulously crafted in pixel art, with a color palette inspired by the classic <i>Rainbow Islands</i>, giving the game both a nostalgic and visually appealing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they progress, players face enemies under the control of darkness, including corrupted animals and Aztec warriors. Axel, with his ability to immobilize enemies and use them as platforms, opens new paths, while Bowie, in his dedicated <i>shoot ’em up</i> stages, destroys them with his divine bow. The game features multiple endings, shaped by the player’s choices throughout the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/19b0326d2f55907f515c93152b9e074a.webp?t=1782584701\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/19b0326d2f55907f515c93152b9e074a.poster.webp?t=1782584701\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two protagonists with unique abilities</strong>: Axel freezes enemies and uses them as platforms, while Bowie fights through shoot 'em up stages, eliminating threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/7028dc819d823b3a0cdaaff07cfd3aa3.webp?t=1782584701\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/7028dc819d823b3a0cdaaff07cfd3aa3.poster.webp?t=1782584701\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Aztec-themed worlds</strong>: From jungles to ancient temples, each world contains five levels with different enemies, puzzles, and final bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro pixel art graphics</strong>: A colorful and nostalgic aesthetic in 320x240 resolution, inspired by the classic <i>Rainbow Islands</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes that define the level of difficulty</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story Mode</i>: more accessible, with infinite retries and saved progress after each level—like <i>ElecHead</i> or <i>VVVVVV</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arcade Mode</i>: designed for expert players, with limited lives and objectives to complete in a single playthrough—like <i>Rainbow Islands</i>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage-based progression system</strong>: You don’t need to finish the whole game in one sitting if you don’t want to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two different endings</strong> depending on the level of challenge achieved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive and culturally inspired narrative</strong>: The story is based on an Aztec prophecy and unfolds through illustrated intros and endings, creating a rich and meaningful experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive soundtrack</strong>: The game features beautiful and catchy melodies that accompany each world, enhancing the atmosphere and gameplay experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/6fcb4c524823fac542a63bc6b628e4af.avif?t=1782584701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras_big/6fcb4c524823fac542a63bc6b628e4af.avif?t=1782584701 width=800 height=361 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/f3ff860fbffd4eb8fbec3d20f95e2426.avif?t=1782584701\" width=366 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Axe &amp; Bow Land</i>, players take on the roles of brothers Axel and Bowie, warriors chosen by an ancient prophecy and armed with sacred relics: a magical axe that can freeze enemies and a divine bow. Set in a mythical era inspired by Aztec culture, the game tells the story of a once-peaceful land, now corrupted by a strange dark energy emerging from an ancient temple. Axel and Bowie, immune to this malevolent force, are the only ones capable of embarking on the journey to restore peace and balance to their homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds across six unique worlds, each containing five levels that offer diverse challenges: from platforming stages filled with puzzles — inspired by games like <i>ElecHead</i> — to intense boss battles and fast-paced <i>shoot ’em up</i> levels. Each world is meticulously crafted in pixel art, with a color palette inspired by the classic <i>Rainbow Islands</i>, giving the game both a nostalgic and visually appealing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they progress, players face enemies under the control of darkness, including corrupted animals and Aztec warriors. Axel, with his ability to immobilize enemies and use them as platforms, opens new paths, while Bowie, in his dedicated <i>shoot ’em up</i> stages, destroys them with his divine bow. The game features multiple endings, shaped by the player’s choices throughout the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/19b0326d2f55907f515c93152b9e074a.webp?t=1782584701\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/19b0326d2f55907f515c93152b9e074a.poster.webp?t=1782584701\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two protagonists with unique abilities</strong>: Axel freezes enemies and uses them as platforms, while Bowie fights through shoot 'em up stages, eliminating threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/7028dc819d823b3a0cdaaff07cfd3aa3.webp?t=1782584701\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/7028dc819d823b3a0cdaaff07cfd3aa3.poster.webp?t=1782584701\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Aztec-themed worlds</strong>: From jungles to ancient temples, each world contains five levels with different enemies, puzzles, and final bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro pixel art graphics</strong>: A colorful and nostalgic aesthetic in 320x240 resolution, inspired by the classic <i>Rainbow Islands</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes that define the level of difficulty</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story Mode</i>: more accessible, with infinite retries and saved progress after each level—like <i>ElecHead</i> or <i>VVVVVV</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arcade Mode</i>: designed for expert players, with limited lives and objectives to complete in a single playthrough—like <i>Rainbow Islands</i>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage-based progression system</strong>: You don’t need to finish the whole game in one sitting if you don’t want to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two different endings</strong> depending on the level of challenge achieved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive and culturally inspired narrative</strong>: The story is based on an Aztec prophecy and unfolds through illustrated intros and endings, creating a rich and meaningful experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive soundtrack</strong>: The game features beautiful and catchy melodies that accompany each world, enhancing the atmosphere and gameplay experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras/6fcb4c524823fac542a63bc6b628e4af.avif?t=1782584701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344770/extras_big/6fcb4c524823fac542a63bc6b628e4af.avif?t=1782584701 width=800 height=361 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
